# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FRONTEND (Vite) — copy to .env.local for local dev.
# Only VITE_* vars reach the browser. Never put a secret in this file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Backend origin. Leave EMPTY for local dev (vite.config.ts proxies /api to
# http://localhost:4000) and for same-domain deploys. Set it to the full API
# origin when the frontend is on Vercel and the API is on Render, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://binary-beats-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=

# Public Discord invite shown on the join buttons and the member gate.
VITE_DISCORD_INVITE=https://discord.gg/your-invite-code
